-                                   │
-                                   ▼
-                            [ LinkService ]
-              ┌────────────────────┼────────────────────┐
-              ▼                    ▼                    ▼
-   [ UrlValidationService ] [ CodeGeneratorService ] [ In-Memory Zero-Filler ]
-   (SSRF / DNS checking)    (Base62 / Alias regex)   (Contiguous UTC range)
-              │                    │                    │
-              └────────────────────┼────────────────────┘
-                                   ▼
+                                  │
+                                  ▼
+                           [ LinkService ]
+              ┌───────────────────┼───────────────────┐
+              ▼                   ▼                   ▼
+   [ UrlValidationService ] [ CodeGenerator ] [ Daily Zero-Filler ]
+     (SSRF & DNS checks)     (Base62 & Regex)     (In-memory loop)
